	(text "TODO: VERIFY MCU SILICON REVISION BEFORE PCB FABRICATION.\nSTM32WB55RGV6 is configured for internal LDO mode at VDD = 3.3V.\nCurrent direct connection assumes REV_ID = 0x2003 (Rev X).\nIf REV_ID = 0x2001 (Rev Y), replace the direct VFBSMPS connection with a series 2.2 ohm resistor \nand 1.8 nH inductor between VLXSMPS and VFBSMPS, per ST AN5290 Section 1.2, Figure 3.\nFirmware must also configure SMPS bypass / LDO mode.\nReference: ST AN5290 Rev 9, p. 6."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
